NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF 1.0) catalog
======================================================

Source
------
NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF 1.0), NIST AI 100-1, January 2023.
https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework
https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.100-1.pdf
Playbook: https://airc.nist.gov/AI_RMF_Knowledge_Base/Playbook

Copyright / licensing status
----------------------------
The NIST AI RMF is a work of the U.S. federal government and is in the public
domain in the United States (17 U.S.C. § 105). NIST publications are not subject
to copyright in the U.S. and may be freely reproduced.

What this catalog contains
--------------------------
- The AI RMF function / category / subcategory CODES (e.g. GOVERN-1.1,
  MAP-2.3, MEASURE-2.6, MANAGE-4.3). These are NIST's identifiers.
- ORIGINAL one-line summaries and descriptions authored for this project. They
  paraphrase the intent of each subcategory; they are NOT verbatim NIST text.
- `frameworkRefs` cross-references to other catalogs (FINOS AIGF, MITRE ATLAS)
  that are our own editorial mapping, not part of the NIST publication.

Even though the NIST text is public domain and could be quoted directly, we use
our own wording so the catalog stays consistent in tone and length with the
other framework catalogs in this repository.

Attribution
-----------
Where this catalog is surfaced to users, attribute the source as:
"Based on the NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF 1.0), NIST AI 100-1."
